[{"y0": 0.04505813942188486, "y1": 0.0624999999676501, "x0": 0.17857143016627183, "x1": 0.25751879638448, "t": "GATE"}, {"y0": 0.0465116280750707, "y1": 0.06249999995303002, "x0": 0.2875939907261634, "x1": 0.7180450998440121, "t": "Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering 2021"}, {"y0": 0.06034351958783846, "y1": 0.07919136426076401, "x0": 0.18019491979842758, "x1": 0.2577750040460765, "t": "2021"}, {"y0": 0.06540697689532271, "y1": 0.08139534877328203, "x0": 0.33458646282362187, "x1": 0.659774432928258, "t": "Organising Institute - IT Bombay"}, {"y0": 0.09011627895676855, "y1": 0.10755813950253379, "x0": 0.33082708907953057, "x1": 0.8496240517099432, "t": "Computer Science and Information Technology (CS, Set-2)"}, {"y0": 0.14244186080771404, "y1": 0.15697674401786732, "x0": 0.16165413549432014, "x1": 0.2011278186034242, "t": "Q.20"}, {"y0": 0.1424242426571214, "y1": 0.15697674398879757, "x0": 0.2330826991146665, "x1": 0.8364661609981158, "t": "Consider a computer system with DMA support. The DMA module is transferring"}, {"y0": 0.15818181811726895, "y1": 0.17151515145060225, "x0": 0.23496241445301191, "x1": 0.8383458763364612, "t": "one 8-bit character in one CPU cycle from a device to memory through cycle stealing"}, {"y0": 0.1744186049526636, "y1": 0.18749999949501084, "x0": 0.234962411310779, "x1": 0.8364661721478676, "t": "at regular intervals. Consider a 2 MHz processor. If 0.5% processor cycles are used"}, {"y0": 0.19030303004217486, "y1": 0.20363636337550828, "x0": 0.23496242137685208, "x1": 0.5902255603900648, "t": "for DMA, the data transfer rate of the device is ."}, {"y0": 0.19030303009062455, "y1": 0.20363636342395786, "x0": 0.6785714318610558, "x1": 0.813909775657741, "t": "- bits per second."}, {"y0": 0.2819767447108168, "y1": 0.3008720927684191, "x0": 0.16165413587563057, "x1": 0.20112781898473467, "t": "Q.21"}, {"y0": 0.28343023257127986, "y1": 0.2981818183293736, "x0": 0.23496239896742088, "x1": 0.8364661598045094, "t": "A data file consisting of 1,50,000 student-records is stored on a hard disk with block"}, {"y0": 0.3006060603833429, "y1": 0.31395348786710386, "x0": 0.23496241043045582, "x1": 0.8383458723139051, "t": "size of 4096 bytes. The data file is sorted on the primary key RollNo. The size of"}, {"y0": 0.3151515152117761, "y1": 0.3299418600280417, "x0": 0.23496239984461373, "x1": 0.8364661606817023, "t": "a record pointer for this disk is 7 bytes. Each student-record has a candidate key"}, {"y0": 0.33139534902952805, "y1": 0.34738372090748737, "x0": 0.23308270012030552, "x1": 0.8364661620037548, "t": "attribute called ANum of size 12 bytes. Suppose an index file with records consisting"}, {"y0": 0.34727272705907763, "y1": 0.363636363422714, "x0": 0.2330827108815835, "x1": 0.8364661727650328, "t": "of two fields, ANum value and the record pointer to the corresponding student record,"}, {"y0": 0.3633720933367839, "y1": 0.3781818179711278, "x0": 0.23120299894862895, "x1": 0.8364661618784389, "t": "is built and stored on the same disk. Assume that the records of data file and index"}, {"y0": 0.37936046530937517, "y1": 0.39393939382333554, "x0": 0.23308270945838272, "x1": 0.836466171341832, "t": "file are not split across disk blocks. The number of blocks in the index file is"}, {"y0": 0.4854651163139274, "y1": 0.5014534881918866, "x0": 0.16353383541913216, "x1": 0.20300751852823623, "t": "Q.22"}, {"y0": 0.4866666666644799, "y1": 0.5014534880876348, "x0": 0.234962411310779, "x1": 0.8364661721478676, "t": "For a given biased coin, the probability that the outcome of a toss is a head is 0.4."}, {"y0": 0.5029069773109485, "y1": 0.5159883718532957, "x0": 0.23496240181829797, "x1": 0.8364661626553865, "t": "This coin is tossed 1,000 times. Let X denote the random variable whose value"}, {"y0": 0.5187878786669052, "y1": 0.533430232302751, "x0": 0.23308269509211024, "x1": 0.8364661569755595, "t": "is the number of times that head appeared in these 1,000 tosses. The standard"}, {"y0": 0.5348837210766094, "y1": 0.5496969696820485, "x0": 0.23308271802159689, "x1": 0.5939849601738917, "t": "deviation of X (rounded to 2 decimal places) is \u2014"}, {"y0": 0.6308139539254466, "y1": 0.6453488371355999, "x0": 0.16353383435354021, "x1": 0.20112781940585825, "t": "Q.23"}, {"y0": 0.6290909090891413, "y1": 0.6454545454527777, "x0": 0.23308270678320905, "x1": 0.5338345872017533, "t": "Consider the following ANSI C function:"}, {"y0": 0.6569696971402986, "y1": 0.6703030304736319, "x0": 0.2349624138724773, "x1": 0.4981202972804049, "t": "int SomeFunction (int x, int y)"}, {"y0": 0.6729651161359076, "y1": 0.6845930231664178, "x0": 0.23496240615058092, "x1": 0.2462406012178401, "t": "{"}, {"y0": 0.6889534887511132, "y1": 0.7020348832934605, "x0": 0.25187971238813456, "x1": 0.5601503730755243, "t": "if ((x == 1) || (y == 1)) return 1;"}, {"y0": 0.7048484845688715, "y1": 0.7181818179022048, "x0": 0.25187970302396406, "x1": 0.4379699272391936, "t": "if (x == y) return x;"}, {"y0": 0.7223837208452101, "y1": 0.7340116278757202, "x0": 0.2537594097289878, "x1": 0.6127819508349218, "t": "if (x > y) return Somefunction(x - y, y);"}, {"y0": 0.7309090910427661, "y1": 0.7499999995556907, "x0": 0.2500000103790556, "x1": 0.612781953577711, "t": "if (y > x) return SomeFunction(x, y - x) ;"}, {"y0": 0.7500000000737024, "y1": 0.7645348832838557, "x0": 0.23308270688366367, "x1": 0.24436090195092286, "t": "}"}, {"y0": 0.778787878836178, "y1": 0.7936046508347279, "x0": 0.2330827103336452, "x1": 0.6071428598104649, "t": "The value returned by SomeFunction (15, 255) is -"}, {"y0": 0.9460606063120072, "y1": 0.9607558137344371, "x0": 0.15225563781797727, "x1": 0.3984962357252559, "t": "CS, Set-2 - Copyright \u00a9 GATE 2021"}, {"y0": 0.9460606060515381, "y1": 0.9578488372943249, "x0": 0.7537593974440009, "x1": 0.8477443600747961, "t": "Page 20 of 43"}]